{"id":"fd20d0fb1ced54f7","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-sigma11.md","title":"无实参数的有效解析类","display":"df-sigma11 — 无实参数的有效解析类","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-sigma11","aliases":["43-df-sigma11"],"display":"df-sigma11 — 无实参数的有效解析类","depends_on":["[[43-df-effective-coding]]","[[43-df-infseq]]","[[43-df-computable]]","[[43-df-oracle-computation]]","[[43-df-string]]"],"source_edition":"书外补充；用户所供2007稿未涵盖","source_locator":"External: effective tree normal form; higher setting of Chong–Nies–Yu §2; https://www.cs.auckland.ac.nz/~nies/papers_till_09/ChongNiesYu_LownessHigherRandomness.pdf","verification_status":"formalization-reviewed","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-sigma11"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-sigma11</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-sigma11 — 无实参数的有效解析类"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"aa33e0ea8422ba2a\" href=\"?note=aa33e0ea8422ba2a\" title=\"43-df-effective-coding\">43-df-effective-coding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"565c3258eee2a5ff\" href=\"?note=565c3258eee2a5ff\" title=\"43-df-infseq\">43-df-infseq</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f357216a7edb035a\" href=\"?note=f357216a7edb035a\" title=\"43-df-computable\">43-df-computable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4400f4836786a4bd\" href=\"?note=4400f4836786a4bd\" title=\"43-df-oracle-computation\">43-df-oracle-computation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"1cb4649e6af56ba4\" href=\"?note=1cb4649e6af56ba4\" title=\"43-df-string\">43-df-string</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"书外补充；用户所供2007稿未涵盖"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"External: effective tree normal form; higher setting of Chong–Nies–Yu §2; <a href=\"https://www.cs.auckland.ac.nz/~nies/papers_till_09/ChongNiesYu_LownessHigherRandomness.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.cs.auckland.ac.nz/~nies/papers_till_09/ChongNiesYu_LownessHigherRandomness.pdf</a>"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"formalization-reviewed"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\cup2^\\omega\">\\(B\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\cup2^\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{AsSet}\">\\(\\operatorname{AsSet}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"565c3258eee2a5ff\" href=\"?note=565c3258eee2a5ff\" title=\"43-df-infseq\">43-df-infseq</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(2^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>、有限串长度、截断及有效编码见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"aa33e0ea8422ba2a\" href=\"?note=aa33e0ea8422ba2a\" title=\"43-df-effective-coding\">43-df-effective-coding</a>；有限序列与无限序列均用函数图表示。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Computable}^{\\operatorname{AsSet}(B)}_{D,E}\">\\(\\mathrm{Computable}^{\\operatorname{AsSet}(B)}_{D,E}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"f357216a7edb035a\" href=\"?note=f357216a7edb035a\" title=\"43-df-computable\">43-df-computable</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span> 是下式定义的等长串对域，其编码 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\#_D\">\\(\\#_D\\)</span> 显式给出；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_{T,D}\">\\(\\chi_{T,D}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"aa33e0ea8422ba2a\" href=\"?note=aa33e0ea8422ba2a\" title=\"43-df-effective-coding\">43-df-effective-coding</a> 中正式定义的特征函数。下式明确自然数串的前缀关系及仅以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{AsSet}(B)\">\\(\\operatorname{AsSet}(B)\\)</span> 为实参数的两个有效解析类族。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"D\\coloneqq\\{(\\sigma,\\tau)\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}:|\\sigma|=|\\tau|\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[D\\coloneqq\\{(\\sigma,\\tau)\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}:|\\sigma|=|\\tau|\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\#_D(\\sigma,\\tau)\\coloneqq\\langle\\#_2(\\sigma),\\#_{\\rm seq}(\\tau)\\rangle\\qquad((\\sigma,\\tau)\\in D).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\#_D(\\sigma,\\tau)\\coloneqq\\langle\\#_2(\\sigma),\\#_{\\rm seq}(\\tau)\\rangle\\qquad((\\sigma,\\tau)\\in D).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\rho,\\tau\\in\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\left(\\rho\\preceq\\tau\\iff\\rho\\subseteq\\tau\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall\\rho,\\tau\\in\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\left(\\rho\\preceq\\tau\\iff\\rho\\subseteq\\tau\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^1_{1,\\mathbb N}(B)\\coloneqq\\left\\{A\\subseteq\\mathbb N:\\exists p\\in\\{0,1\\}^{\\mathbb N\\times\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}}\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Computable}^{\\operatorname{AsSet}(B)}_{\\mathbb N\\times\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega},\\{0,1\\}}(p)\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall\\tau,\\rho\\in\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\\;(\\rho\\preceq\\tau\\land p(n,\\tau)=1\\Rightarrow p(n,\\rho)=1)\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\left(n\\in A\\iff\\exists f\\in\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N}\\;\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;p(n,f\\upharpoonright k)=1\\right)\\right)\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Sigma^1_{1,\\mathbb N}(B)\\coloneqq\\left\\{A\\subseteq\\mathbb N:\\exists p\\in\\{0,1\\}^{\\mathbb N\\times\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}}\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Computable}^{\\operatorname{AsSet}(B)}_{\\mathbb N\\times\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega},\\{0,1\\}}(p)\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall\\tau,\\rho\\in\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\\;(\\rho\\preceq\\tau\\land p(n,\\tau)=1\\Rightarrow p(n,\\rho)=1)\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\left(n\\in A\\iff\\exists f\\in\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N}\\;\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;p(n,f\\upharpoonright k)=1\\right)\\right)\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^1_1(2^\\omega;B)\\coloneqq\\left\\{A\\subseteq2^\\omega:\\exists T\\subseteq D\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Computable}^{\\operatorname{AsSet}(B)}_{D,\\{0,1\\}}(\\chi_{T,D})\\land\\forall(\\sigma,\\tau)\\in T\\;\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;(k\\le|\\sigma|\\Rightarrow(\\sigma\\upharpoonright k,\\tau\\upharpoonright k)\\in T)\\land\\forall X\\in2^\\omega\\;\\left(X\\in A\\iff\\exists f\\in\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N}\\;\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;(X\\upharpoonright k,f\\upharpoonright k)\\in T\\right)\\right)\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Sigma^1_1(2^\\omega;B)\\coloneqq\\left\\{A\\subseteq2^\\omega:\\exists T\\subseteq D\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Computable}^{\\operatorname{AsSet}(B)}_{D,\\{0,1\\}}(\\chi_{T,D})\\land\\forall(\\sigma,\\tau)\\in T\\;\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;(k\\le|\\sigma|\\Rightarrow(\\sigma\\upharpoonright k,\\tau\\upharpoonright k)\\in T)\\land\\forall X\\in2^\\omega\\;\\left(X\\in A\\iff\\exists f\\in\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N}\\;\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;(X\\upharpoonright k,f\\upharpoonright k)\\in T\\right)\\right)\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^1_{1,\\mathbb N}\\coloneqq\\Sigma^1_{1,\\mathbb N}(\\varnothing),\\qquad\\Sigma^1_1(2^\\omega)\\coloneqq\\Sigma^1_1(2^\\omega;\\varnothing).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Sigma^1_{1,\\mathbb N}\\coloneqq\\Sigma^1_{1,\\mathbb N}(\\varnothing),\\qquad\\Sigma^1_1(2^\\omega)\\coloneqq\\Sigma^1_1(2^\\omega;\\varnothing).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>自然数有限序列采用43内部明确构造的编码；前缀就是函数图包含，树的特征函数总定义在等长串对的可判定域 D 上。相对版本只使用一个指定的实参数；无参数版本使用空集合。整数集合与Cantor空间点集的两个类族保持区分。</p>\n<p>有效树投影形式及既有外部出处定位沿用附件；本轮展开编码、类型与参数转换，未额外引入其他实参数或高阶概念。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-effective-coding","status":"resolved","id":"aa33e0ea8422ba2a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-effective-coding]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-infseq","status":"resolved","id":"565c3258eee2a5ff","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-infseq]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"f357216a7edb035a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-oracle-computation","status":"resolved","id":"4400f4836786a4bd","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-oracle-computation]]","embed":false},{"target"