\\omega;B)\\coloneqq\\left\\{A\\subseteq2^\\omega:\\exists T\\subseteq D\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Computable}^{\\operatorname{AsSet}(B)}_{D,\\{0,1\\}}(\\chi_{T,D})\\land\\forall(\\sigma,\\tau)\\in T\\;\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;(k\\le|\\sigma|\\Rightarrow(\\sigma\\upharpoonright k,\\tau\\upharpoonright k)\\in T)\\land\\forall X\\in2^\\omega\\;\\left(X\\in A\\iff\\exists f\\in\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N}\\;\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;(X\\upharpoonright k,f\\upharpoonright k)\\in T\\right)\\right)\\right\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\Sigma^1_{1,\\mathbb N}\\coloneqq\\Sigma^1_{1,\\mathbb N}(\\varnothing),\\qquad\\Sigma^1_1(2^\\omega)\\coloneqq\\Sigma^1_1(2^\\omega;\\varnothing).","display":true}],"bytes":3251,"backlinks":[{"id":"5bdf9b99211ed117","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A,B\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\cup2^\\omega$；$\\operatorname{AsSet}$ 见 [[43-df-infseq]]，有效解析与余解析类见 [[43-df-sigma11]]、[[43-df-pi11]]。$\\mathrm{HYP}$ 是自然数集合的类；$\\le_h$ 同时接受集合及特征序列。"},{"id":"689c9916fcffb575","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$B\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\cup2^\\omega$；$\\operatorname{AsSet}$ 见 [[43-df-infseq]]，$\\Sigma^1_1$ 的整数域与 Cantor 空间形式见 [[43-df-sigma11]]。"},{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-512","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-df-sigma11]] — 无实参数的有效解析类"}],"outgoing":["aa33e0ea8422ba2a","565c3258eee2a5ff","f357216a7edb035a","4400f4836786a4bd","1cb4649e6af56ba4"]}